**Finding: compliant** (no redline proposed)

The agreement contains no non-solicitation, no-hire, or anti-poaching covenant. Term searches for "solicit", "induce", "recruit", "hire" and "employ" surface only:

- **p0066** — independent contractor / no employment relationship boilerplate;
- **p0061** — confidentiality permission to disclose to employees and directors;
- **p0047, p0051, p0052** — indemnity references to employees and "third party hired by, employed, retained or under [a party's] control".

The miscellaneous block (p0064–p0073, covering governing law, publicity, notices, severability/survival, force majeure, assignment, third-party beneficiaries) has no restrictive covenant either. AP is therefore subject to no non-solicit at all, which matches the playbook's **preferred** position, so no edit is warranted.
